      "title": "Managed SDK child shutdown restarts its cleanup budget between phases and excludes final acknowledgements",
      "repair": "The private control client owns one monotonic cleanup deadline per attempt. Nested model/resource cleanup and their requests inherit it; pending admission and final reports remain inside the aggregate wait. Consumer grace reserves the final request interval. Timeout rejects cleanup and retains exact completion identities. Closed control connections refuse late cleanup admission; active budget shutdown calls share one pending task."
    }
